1..12
ok 1 - for works with an <...> array literal
ok 2 - for works with an (<...>) array literal
ok 3 - for works with an (a_single_constant,) array literal
ok 4 - for works with (a_single_constant)
ok 5 - for works with "a_single_constant"
ok 6 - for ($arrayitem,) {...} executes the loop body only once
ok 7 - for ($arrayitem) {...} executes the loop body only once
ok 8 - for $arrayitem {...} executes the loop body only once
ok 9 - for on (a_single_var,) -> is rw
ok 10 - for on (a_single_var) -> is rw
ok 11 - for on a_single_var -> is rw
ok 12 - for $capture {...} executes the loop body only once
